(b) under clause (b) of sub-section (1) of section 33-1 is again convicted of an offence under that clause, shall be punishable with imprisonment for a term which shall not be less than two years but which may extend to six years and with fine which shall not be less than 92[one lakh rupees or three times the value of the drugs confiscated, whichever is more]:
